<title>MEXICO: Mexico's Pemex lowers natural gas prices.</title>
<headline>Mexico's Pemex lowers natural gas prices.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexican state oil and gas company Petroleos Mexicanos (Pemex) said on Monday that natural gas prices in Mexico fell an average of 30 percent as of February 1.</p>
<p>Pemex said in a statement it was likely that natural gas prices would continue to fall in the coming months as the northern winter season ends.</p>
<p>The state monopoly sets natural gas prices each month according to a formula that takes into account prevailing international prices, the statement said.</p>
<p>(--Mexico City newsroom, +525 728-9565)</p>
</text>
